 "text": "Hi, how have you been? That's a common struggle. One trick is drawing eyeballs from the side, rather than directly on top of the face. About halfway. Start with the lid line, then add the temples, and only once those are in add the eyes. Draw the nose from the side, then layer it in with a few simple lines. Fun experiment. A full face is easier than one eye, so don't stop at just the lid.",
